STM32CubeWB
###########

Origin:
   ST Microelectronics
   https://www.st.com/en/embedded-software/stm32cubewl3.html

Status:
   version v1.3.1

Purpose:
   ST Microelectronics official MCU Package for STM32WL3 series.

Description:
   This package is an extract of official STM32CubeWL3 package written by ST Microelectronics.
   It is composed of STM32Cube hardware abstraction layer (HAL) and low layer (LL) plus a set
   of CMSIS headers files, one for each SoC in STM32WL3 series.

Dependencies:
    None.

URL:
   https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeWL3

